Copyright (C) 2026 Hieu Nguyen

The upstream copyright and license notices are preserved. Contributions by
other upstream contributors are recorded in the git history.

Modifications
-------------
Modifications by Blue Pine Solutions, 2026-09-28.

Downstream changes in this repository to date:

- Manual (self-hosted) domain setup works without Cloudflare credentials.
- MX setup for manually managed domains no longer attempts a Cloudflare
  lookup.
- The inbound SMTP listener rejects recipients that do not exist on this
  installation instead of accepting them.
- Forwarding on the self-hosted (Node) runtime now adds the
  X-Mailflare-Forwarded loop-protection header, as the other runtimes do.
- Custom branding, multiple accounts, shared mailboxes and account
  forwarding are governed by a Blue Pine feature policy instead of
  upstream's commercial license tiers.
- Upstream's commercial licensing integration (Paymug license activation
  and the related pricing and upgrade screens) has been removed.
- The product is identified as Blue Pine Mail, with an About page and a
  source link in the application, and user-facing text names Blue Pine
  Mail or the administrator's configured app name.
- Upstream's in-app updater, which replaced an installation with the
  latest upstream code, has been removed. The application now only checks
  for approved Blue Pine Mail releases and never installs them itself.
- The documentation describes the Blue Pine Mail distribution; upstream
  sponsorship, pricing and promotional material has been removed.

The git history of https://github.com/blue-pine-solutions/blue-pine-mail
identifies each change individually.

